 8.  ACCORDINGLY,  IT  IS  ORDERED,  pursuant  to  authority  delegated  under  sections  0.91,  0.291,  and  54.722(  a)  of  the  Commission's  rules,  47  C.  F.  R.  §§  0.91,  0.291,  and 


 54.722(  a),  that  the  Request  for  Review  filed  by  Locust  Valley  Library,  Locust  Valley,  New  York,  on  January  11,  2002  IS  DENIED. 


